# Harness Optimizer Playbook & Learned Heuristics

This playbook records empirically verified optimization rules, successful refactoring patterns, and observed regression traps for the current project. Consult this document before each mutation step.

---

## 1. Project-Specific Invariants & Contracts

- **Frozen Public Interfaces**: List public signatures, CLI flags, or API formats that must never change.
- **Resource Limits**: Max memory ceiling, latency budget, or timeout limits.

---

## 2. Winning Hypotheses & Effective Patterns

*(Append verified changes that reduced composite loss)*

- `[Epoch 1]`: Replaced quadratic lookup with dictionary hash index -> Latency reduced by 45%.
- `[Epoch 2]`: Added memoization cache to recursive sub-problem -> Eliminated duplicate subtree computation.
- `[Pattern - Real-Time Streaming/Audio]`: Never lock per-sample or per-frame; use local batching to reduce mutex acquisition frequency by >99%.
- `[Pattern - High-Load Resilience]`: Size decoded buffers to cover peak OS thread scheduling starvation windows (>= 10-12s) and elevate process priority class.

