## 3. Regression Traps & Negative Heuristics

*(Append hypotheses that triggered rollbacks or compile errors to prevent repetitive attempts)*

- `[Trap - Avoid]`: Modifying type signatures in `core/types.py` broke external consumer modules.
- `[Trap - Avoid]`: Inline regex parsing caused catastrophic backtracking on large inputs; prefer tokenizer.
- `[Trap - Avoid]`: Interleaving arbitrary zero/silence samples into real-time audio streams introduces waveform discontinuities and flutter jitter.

